\size default 
The state diagram highlights several points.
 
\layout Enumerate

There are no transitions to a state below 0.
\layout Enumerate

There is no maximum value for the state shown, this implies that 
\begin_inset Formula $k$
\end_inset 

 is unbounded.
\layout Enumerate

