 queue.
\begin_inset LatexCommand \label{cap:discreteMM1}

\end_inset 


\end_inset 

The simulation consists of a loop over discrete time steps.
 For each time step there are three possible events: the state of the system
 increases by one; the state of the system decreases by one and the state
 of the system stays the same.
 Modelling the queue is therefore a simple matter of testing which of these
 outcomes is true.
 
